B.ct2=new A.K(B.vX,["Beenden","Das Ger\xe4t nimmt gerade auf. Aufnahme jetzt beenden?","Aufnahme konnte nicht beendet werden: {error}","Das Stoppen der Aufnahme wird auf diesem Ger\xe4t nicht unterst\xfctzt","Aufnahme beendet","Stoppen","Das Ger\xe4t \xfcbertr\xe4gt Offline-Daten. \xdcbertragung jetzt stoppen?","Offline-Daten\xfcbertragung konnte nicht gestoppt werden: {error}","Das Stoppen der Offline-Daten\xfcbertragung wird auf diesem Ger\xe4t nicht unterst\xfctzt","Offline-Daten\xfcbertragung gestoppt","Produkt-Wiederverbindung","{product}-Produktendpunkte werden verbunden","Produkt verbindet","Prim\xe4rer Endpunkt von {product} wieder verbunden, sekund\xe4rer Endpunkt wird gesucht","Prim\xe4rer Endpunkt von {product} wieder verbunden, sekund\xe4rer Endpunkt gefunden, Verbindung ausstehend","Verbindung ausstehend","Erkennung ausstehend","Prim\xe4rer Endpunkt von {product} wieder verbunden, Status des sekund\xe4ren Endpunkts wird erwartet","{product} als Produkt wieder verbunden","Ger\xe4t entbinden","Entbinden","Beim Entbinden wird der Ger\xe4tespeicher gel\xf6scht und die Daten k\xf6nnen nicht wiederhergestellt werden. Fortfahren?","Das Ger\xe4t ist nicht verbunden. Wenn Sie mit dem Entbinden fortfahren, wird der Offline-Entbindungsmodus verwendet (nach dem Offline-Entbinden \xe4ndert sich das Ger\xe4t selbst nicht. Wenn sich der n\xe4chste Benutzer verbindet und bindet, werden alle Daten im Ger\xe4t dauerhaft gel\xf6scht und k\xf6nnen nicht wiederhergestellt werden). M\xf6chten Sie wirklich entbinden?","Das Ger\xe4t nimmt gerade auf. M\xf6chten Sie es entbinden? Beim Entbinden wird diese Aufnahme nicht gespeichert, und alle Aufnahmen sowie nicht synchronisierten Daten werden dauerhaft gel\xf6scht und k\xf6nnen nicht wiederhergestellt werden.","Hinweis","Ger\xe4t entbunden, aber die Serversynchronisierung ist fehlgeschlagen. Bitte pr\xfcfen Sie Ihr Netzwerk.","Entbinden fehlgeschlagen: {error}","Ger\xe4t erfolgreich entbunden"],t.w)
B.ct3=new A.K(B.vX,["\uc885\ub8cc","\uae30\uae30\uac00 \ub179\uc74c \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc9c0\uae08 \ub179\uc74c\uc744 \uc885\ub8cc\ud560\uae4c\uc694?","\ub179\uc74c \uc885\ub8cc \uc2e4\ud328: {error}","\uc774 \uae30\uae30\ub294 \ub179\uc74c \uc911\uc9c0\ub97c \uc9c0\uc6d0\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4","\ub179\uc74c\uc774 \uc885\ub8cc\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4","\uc911\uc9c0","\uae30\uae30\uac00 \uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ub370\uc774\ud130\ub97c \uc804\uc1a1 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc9c0\uae08 \uc804\uc1a1\uc744 \uc911\uc9c0\ud560\uae4c\uc694?","\uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ub370\uc774\ud130 \uc804\uc1a1 \uc911\uc9c0 \uc2e4\ud328: {error}","\uc774 \uae30\uae30\ub294 \uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ub370\uc774\ud130 \uc804\uc1a1 \uc911\uc9c0\ub97c \uc9c0\uc6d0\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4","\uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ub370\uc774\ud130 \uc804\uc1a1\uc774 \uc911\uc9c0\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4","\uc81c\ud488 \uc7ac\uc5f0\uacb0","{product} \uc81c\ud488 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8 \uc5f0\uacb0 \uc911","\uc81c\ud488 \uc5f0\uacb0 \uc911","{product} \uae30\ubcf8 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8\uac00 \uc7ac\uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\uc5c8\uace0 \ubcf4\uc870 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8\ub97c \uac80\uc0c9 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4","{product} \uae30\ubcf8 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8\uac00 \uc7ac\uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\uc5c8\uace0 \ubcf4\uc870 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8\ub97c \ucc3e\uc558\uc73c\uba70 \uc5f0\uacb0 \ub300\uae30 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4","\uc5f0\uacb0 \ub300\uae30","\uac80\uc0c9 \ub300\uae30","{product} \uae30\ubcf8 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8\uac00 \uc7ac\uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\uc5c8\uace0 \ubcf4\uc870 \uc5d4\ub4dc\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8 \uc0c1\ud0dc\ub97c \uae30\ub2e4\ub9ac\ub294 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4","{product}\uc774 \uc81c\ud488\uc73c\ub85c \uc7ac\uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4","\uae30\uae30 \ubc14\uc778\ub529 \ud574\uc81c","\ud574\uc81c","\ubc14\uc778\ub529\uc744 \ud574\uc81c\ud558\uba74 \uae30\uae30 \uc800\uc7a5\uc18c\uac00 \uc0ad\uc81c\ub418\uba70 \ub370\uc774\ud130\ub294 \ubcf5\uad6c\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uacc4\uc18d\ud560\uae4c\uc694?","\uae30\uae30\uac00 \uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uacc4\uc18d \ud574\uc81c\ud558\uba74 \uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ud574\uc81c \ubaa8\ub4dc\ub97c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4(\uc624\ud504\ub77c\uc778 \ud574\uc81c \ud6c4 \uae30\uae30 \uc790\uccb4\ub294 \ubcc0\uacbd\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc74c \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \uc5f0\uacb0\ud558\uace0 \ubc14\uc778\ub529\ud558\uba74 \uae30\uae30 \uc548\uc758 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ub370\uc774\ud130\uac00 \uc601\uad6c \uc0ad\uc81c\ub418\uba70 \ubcf5\uad6c\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4). \ubc14\uc778\ub529\uc744 \ud574\uc81c\ud560\uae4c\uc694?","\uae30\uae30\uac00 \ub179\uc74c \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubc14\uc778\ub529\uc744 \ud574\uc81c\ud560\uae4c\uc694? \ud574\uc81c\ud558\uba74 \uc774 \ub179\uc74c\uc740 \uc800\uc7a5\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba70 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ub179\uc74c\uacfc \ubbf8\ub3d9\uae30\ud654 \ub370\uc774\ud130\uac00 \uc601\uad6c \uc0ad\uc81c\ub418\uc5b4 \ubcf5\uad6c\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.","\uc54c\ub9bc","\uae30\uae30 \ubc14\uc778\ub529\uc740 \ud574\uc81c\ub418\uc5c8\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc11c\ubc84 \ub3d9\uae30\ud654\uc5d0 \uc2e4\ud328\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub124\ud2b8\uc6cc\ud06c\ub97c \ud655\uc778\ud574 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694.","\ubc14\uc778\ub529 \ud574\uc81c \uc2e4\ud328: {error}","\uae30\uae30 \ubc14\uc778\ub529\uc774 \ud574\uc81c\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4"],t.w)
B.ct4=new A.K(B.vX,["Terminer","L\u2019appareil enregistre actuellement. Terminer l\u2019enregistrement maintenant ?","\xc9chec de la fin de l\u2019enregistrement : {error}","L\u2019arr\xeat de l\u2019enregistrement n\u2019est pas pris en charge sur cet appareil","Enregistrement termin\xe9","Arr\xeater","L\u2019appareil transf\xe8re des donn\xe9es hors ligne. Arr\xeater le transfert maintenant ?","\xc9chec de l\u2019arr\xeat du transfert de donn\xe9es hors ligne : {error}","L\u2019arr\xeat du transfert de donn\xe9es hors ligne n\u2019est pas pris en charge sur cet appareil","Transfert de donn\xe9es hors ligne arr\xeat\xe9","Reconnexion produit","Connexion des endpoints produit de {product}","Connexion du produit","Endpoint principal de {product} reconnect\xe9, recherche de l\u2019endpoint secondaire","Endpoint principal de {product} reconnect\xe9, endpoint secondaire trouv\xe9, connexion en attente","Connexion en attente","D\xe9couverte en attente","Endpoint principal de {product} reconnect\xe9, attente de l\u2019\xe9tat de l\u2019endpoint secondaire","{product} reconnect\xe9 comme produit","Dissocier l\u2019appareil","Dissocier","La dissociation effacera le stockage de l\u2019appareil et les donn\xe9es ne pourront pas \xeatre r\xe9cup\xe9r\xe9es. Continuer ?","L\u2019appareil n\u2019est pas connect\xe9. Si vous continuez, le mode de dissociation hors ligne sera utilis\xe9 (apr\xe8s la dissociation hors ligne, l\u2019appareil lui-m\xeame ne changera pas. Lorsque le prochain utilisateur se connectera et l\u2019associera, toutes les donn\xe9es de l\u2019appareil seront supprim\xe9es d\xe9finitivement et ne pourront pas \xeatre r\xe9cup\xe9r\xe9es). Voulez-vous vraiment dissocier ?","L\u2019appareil enregistre actuellement. Voulez-vous le dissocier ? En cas de dissociation, cet enregistrement ne sera pas enregistr\xe9, et tous les enregistrements ainsi que les donn\xe9es non synchronis\xe9es seront supprim\xe9s d\xe9finitivement et ne pourront pas \xeatre r\xe9cup\xe9r\xe9s.","Avis","Appareil dissoci\xe9, mais la synchronisation serveur a \xe9chou\xe9. V\xe9rifiez votre r\xe9seau.","\xc9chec de la dissociation : {error}","Appareil dissoci\xe9 avec succ\xe8s"],t.w)
B.ct5=new A.K(B.vX,["Akhiri","Perangkat sedang merekam. Akhiri rekaman sekarang?","Gagal mengakhiri rekaman: {error}","Menghentikan rekaman tidak didukung di perangkat ini","Rekaman diakhiri","Hentikan","Perangkat sedang mentransfer data offline. Hentikan transfer sekarang?","Gagal menghentikan transfer data offline: {error}","Menghentikan transfer data offline tidak didukung di perangkat ini","Transfer data offline dihentikan","Koneksi ulang produk","Endpoint produk {product} sedang terhubung","Produk menghubungkan","Endpoint utama {product} terhubung kembali, mencari endpoint sekunder","Endpoint utama {product} terhubung kembali, endpoint sekunder ditemukan, menunggu koneksi","Menunggu koneksi","Menunggu pencarian","Endpoint utama {product} terhubung kembali, menunggu status endpoint sekunder","{product} terhubung kembali sebagai produk","Lepaskan tautan perangkat","Lepaskan tautan","Melepas tautan akan menghapus penyimpanan perangkat dan data tidak dapat dipulihkan. Lanjutkan?","Perangkat tidak terhubung. Jika melanjutkan, mode lepas tautan offline akan digunakan (setelah lepas tautan offline, perangkat tidak berubah. Saat pengguna berikutnya terhubung dan menautkan, semua data di perangkat akan dihapus permanen dan tidak dapat dipulihkan). Yakin ingin melepas tautan?","Perangkat sedang merekam. Ingin melepas tautan? Jika dilepas, rekaman ini tidak akan disimpan, dan semua rekaman serta data yang belum disinkronkan akan dihapus permanen dan tidak dapat dipulihkan.","Pemberitahuan","Perangkat telah dilepas tautannya, tetapi sinkronisasi server gagal. Periksa jaringan Anda.","Gagal melepas tautan: {error}","Perangkat berhasil dilepas tautannya"],t.w)
B.ct6=new A.K(B.vX,["Finalizar","El dispositivo est\xe1 grabando. \xbfFinalizar la grabaci\xf3n ahora?","No se pudo finalizar la grabaci\xf3n: {error}","Este dispositivo no admite detener la grabaci\xf3n","Grabaci\xf3n finalizada","Detener","El dispositivo est\xe1 transfiriendo datos sin conexi\xf3n. \xbfDetener la transferencia ahora?","No se pudo detener la transferencia de datos sin conexi\xf3n: {error}","Este dispositivo no admite detener la transferencia de datos sin conexi\xf3n","Transferencia de datos sin conexi\xf3n detenida","Reconexi\xf3n de producto","Conectando endpoints de producto de {product}","Producto conectando","Endpoint principal de {product} reconectado; buscando endpoint secundario","Endpoint principal de {product} reconectado; endpoint secundario encontrado, conexi\xf3n pendiente","Conexi\xf3n pendiente","Detecci\xf3n pendiente","Endpoint principal de {product} reconectado; esperando estado del endpoint secundario","{product} reconectado como producto","Desvincular dispositivo","Desvincular","La desvinculaci\xf3n borrar\xe1 el almacenamiento del dispositivo y los datos no se podr\xe1n recuperar. \xbfContinuar?","El dispositivo no est\xe1 conectado. Si contin\xfaas, se usar\xe1 el modo de desvinculaci\xf3n sin conexi\xf3n (despu\xe9s de desvincular sin conexi\xf3n, el dispositivo no cambiar\xe1. Cuando el siguiente usuario se conecte y vincule, todos los datos del dispositivo se eliminar\xe1n de forma permanente y no se podr\xe1n recuperar). \xbfSeguro que quieres desvincular?","El dispositivo est\xe1 grabando. \xbfQuieres desvincularlo? Si se desvincula, esta grabaci\xf3n no se guardar\xe1, y todas las grabaciones y datos no sincronizados se eliminar\xe1n permanentemente y no se podr\xe1n recuperar.","Aviso","Dispositivo desvinculado, pero fall\xf3 la sincronizaci\xf3n con el servidor. Revisa la red.","No se pudo desvincular: {error}","Dispositivo desvinculado correctamente"],t.w)
B.ct7=new A.K(B.vX,["Encerrar","O dispositivo est\xe1 gravando. Encerrar a grava\xe7\xe3o agora?","Falha ao encerrar grava\xe7\xe3o: {error}","Parar a grava\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o \xe9 compat\xedvel com este dispositivo","Grava\xe7\xe3o encerrada","Parar","O dispositivo est\xe1 transferindo dados offline. Parar a transfer\xeancia agora?","Falha ao parar a transfer\xeancia de dados offline: {error}","Parar a transfer\xeancia de dados offline n\xe3o \xe9 compat\xedvel com este dispositivo","Transfer\xeancia de dados offline parada","Reconex\xe3o do produto","Conectando endpoints do produto {product}","Produto conectando","Endpoint prim\xe1rio de {product} reconectado, descobrindo endpoint secund\xe1rio","Endpoint prim\xe1rio de {product} reconectado, endpoint secund\xe1rio encontrado, conex\xe3o pendente","Conex\xe3o pendente","Descoberta pendente","Endpoint prim\xe1rio de {product} reconectado, aguardando status do endpoint secund\xe1rio","{product} reconectado como produto","Desvincular dispositivo","Desvincular","A desvincula\xe7\xe3o limpar\xe1 o armazenamento do dispositivo e os dados n\xe3o poder\xe3o ser recuperados. Continuar?","O dispositivo n\xe3o est\xe1 conectado. Se continuar, ser\xe1 usado o modo de desvincula\xe7\xe3o offline (ap\xf3s a desvincula\xe7\xe3o offline, o pr\xf3prio dispositivo n\xe3o mudar\xe1. Quando o pr\xf3ximo usu\xe1rio conectar e vincular, todos os dados no dispositivo ser\xe3o exclu\xeddos permanentemente e n\xe3o poder\xe3o ser recuperados). Tem certeza de que deseja desvincular?","O dispositivo est\xe1 gravando. Deseja desvincular? Se desvinculado, esta grava\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o ser\xe1 salva, e todas as grava\xe7\xf5es e dados n\xe3o sincronizados ser\xe3o exclu\xeddos permanentemente e n\xe3o poder\xe3o ser recuperados.","Aviso","Dispositivo desvinculado, mas a sincroniza\xe7\xe3o com o servidor falhou. Verifique sua rede.","Falha ao desvincular: {error}","Dispositivo desvinculado com sucesso"],t.w)
